flowchart TD
    A[Developer pushes commit<br/>to GitHub] --> B[GitHub Webhook<br/>/github-webhook/]
    B --> C[Jenkins Multibranch Scan]
    C --> D[Branch Job Starts]

    D --> E[Stage: Checkout]
    E --> F[Stage: Backend Tests and SAST<br/>pytest + bandit + pip-audit]
    F --> G{Backend stage pass?}
    G -- No --> Z1[Pipeline FAILED]
    G -- Yes --> H[Stage: Frontend Audit<br/>npm ci + npm audit]
    H --> I{Frontend stage pass?}
    I -- No --> Z1
    I -- Yes --> J[Stage: Build Containers<br/>docker compose build]
    J --> K{Build stage pass?}
    K -- No --> Z1
    K -- Yes --> L{Branch == master-staging?}

    L -- No --> Z2[CI SUCCESS<br/>No deploy]
    L -- Yes --> M[Stage: Deploy Staging VM<br/>SSH with Jenkins credentials]
    M --> N[On VM: git fetch/checkout/pull]
    N --> O[On VM: docker compose up -d --build --remove-orphans]
    O --> P[On VM: health check<br/>curl localhost:8080/healthz with retries]
    P --> Q{Health check pass?}
    Q -- No --> R[Collect docker compose ps + logs]
    R --> Z1
    Q -- Yes --> Z3[CI/CD SUCCESS<br/>Staging updated]
